    "summary": "Slaanesh's Chosen errata: the Effect of Refusal to be Outdone is replaced. As the unit declares a charge, it may use this if an enemy unit that is already engaged stands no more than 12\" away; it then may re-roll its Charge rolls, but its Charge move has to finish engaged with at least one of those enemy units. In this version the signed app already prints a rewritten Refusal to be Outdone that does not match this change, so the official sources disagree.",
